flowchart TD
  start([首次启动]) --> intent{用户意图}
  intent -->|实时让电脑做事| cockpit[Agent Cockpit]
  intent -->|编辑可复用流程| studio[Automation Studio]
  intent -->|录制演示或复用| replay[Replay Lab]

  cockpit --> preflight[运行前体检]
  preflight --> observe[观察窗口和屏幕]
  observe --> act[执行动作]
  act --> verify{证据验证}
  verify -->|成功| crystallize[结晶为模板或 WPS]
  verify -->|失败| classify[失败分类与恢复]
  classify --> recover[窗口聚焦 / OCR替代 / 动态等待 / 重新定位]
  recover --> verify

  studio --> search[自然语言搜索指令库]
  search --> compose[生成节点组合]
  compose --> layout[主路径垂直排版]
  layout --> gates[插入验证门]
  gates --> run[运行或调试]
  run --> evidence[查看证据面板]

  replay --> trace[选择 trace 或 WPS]
  trace --> map[映射到 FlowScript]
  map --> editable{是否可等价编辑}
  editable -->|是| importFlow[导入流程图]
  editable -->|否| wpsOnly[保留 WPS 占位并原样重放]
  importFlow --> studio
  crystallize --> template[模板与知识库]
  template --> search
